cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use adql-copilot in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "adql-copilot: a schema-aware ADQL linter for Virtual Observatory TAP endpoints"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic, machine-readable ADQL linter that validates queries against a
  live TAP_SCHEMA (Gaia and other VO endpoints) before they run — catching unknown
  tables/columns, missing spatial constraints, and archive-specific join pitfalls —
  designed as the trustworthy validation gate for LLM-assisted (NL->ADQL) query
  generation.
